  "description": "I can't escape his piercing blue eyes...\n\nSoon to be wed, Princess Rosetta embarks on the final journey of her freedom. During the trip the party are saved by a strange woman. But when it turns out her injured savior is also due to be wed, Rosetta volunteers to help the ceremony proceed. Little does she know her world is about to change.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
